63em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is unit lower triangular.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch03-linear-systems/06-lu-factorization.html"}